<p>Once per week, SCP-2545 is to be emptied until it is 10% full, and the extraneous material delivered to the on-site cafeteria for consumption by staff. The cafeteria staff are to incinerate any leftovers after a period of one week. SCP-2545 should not be kept empty for more than 24 hours.</p>
